    p(text: "The 14 external production file-hold consumers/readers are: gunbc.fabric.fabric_cell_grant; gunbc.fabric.fabric_control_plane; gunbc.fleet.printer_execution_hold; gunbc.host.managed_host_unit_hold; gunbc.machine_intake.arrival_interlock; gunbc.workspace_allocation_lifecycle; gunbc.workspace_allocation_plan; gunbc.workspace_allocation_supply; gunbc.workspace_commissioning_admission_observe; gunbc.workspace_commissioning_executor_fence; gunbc.workspace_commissioning_executor_submission; gunbc.workspace_commissioning_fleet; gunbc.workspace_commissioning_observe; gunbc.workspace_slot_mutation. The other two members are gunbc.durable_exclusive_hold_file_store and extdeps.realization.materialization_store_local. Retain these on their existing exclusion authority until a dedicated replacement preserves owner/generation fencing, liveness, recovery and release. The seven allocation/commissioning reader modules in this list accompany any writer migration; they are not ordinary object-store adopters."),
